WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.210
A strange old folk tale.

2
00:00:02.260 --> 00:00:07.390
Ghosts, a journey down a river,
an ending that makes no sense.

3
00:00:07.440 --> 00:00:10.580
You read it, then tell it
to a friend a week later.

4
00:00:10.630 --> 00:00:12.020
Then a month later.

5
00:00:12.070 --> 00:00:13.630
Then a year later.

6
00:00:13.680 --> 00:00:16.460
Each time it comes out a little different.

7
00:00:16.510 --> 00:00:19.840
So who, or what, is rewriting it?

8
00:00:19.890 --> 00:00:22.240
Are the details just fading away?

9
00:00:22.290 --> 00:00:24.620
Are you polishing it on purpose?

10
00:00:24.670 --> 00:00:28.610
In this mission, you'll find
that memory is not a recording.

11
00:00:28.660 --> 00:00:32.050
Whenever you remember
something, you reconstruct it.

12
00:00:32.100 --> 00:00:36.680
And you'll meet schemas: mental
frameworks of knowledge and expectations,

13
00:00:36.730 --> 00:00:39.010
like what happens at a birthday party.

14
00:00:39.060 --> 00:00:43.230
Your mission: work out who,
or what, edits the story.
